= Token (blockchain) — Technical =

A token model defines state, ownership/control semantics, issuance and destruction rules, transfer transitions, authorization, and any metadata or external linkage. Security therefore depends on both ledger consensus and token-contract/protocol semantics; external claims require additional trust or verification.

== Modeling / security cautions ==
* blockchain token ≠ cryptocurrency by definition
* token record ≠ external asset itself
* token ≠ authentication token / language token

